# POC-VMS-41 post-hoc diagnostic audit tests

- Confirm the repository review validates only as non-independent, non-blind, non-confirmatory and `NOT_QUALIFIED`.
- Confirm blindness, purpose, eligibility and qualification cannot be upgraded by input edits.
- Confirm the exact four frozen case IDs and attempt IDs are required once and in order.
- Confirm seal, read-only verify and identical reopen succeed without overwriting.
- Confirm review tampering, a symlink artifact and source receipt drift fail closed.
- Confirm a partial directory and its evidence are preserved rather than deleted or overwritten.
- Confirm tests use only temporary directories and mocked source bindings; they do not touch the D audit root or invoke a model, Solver, DB, Redis, Seven or network.
